OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fsome clear spells and light winds
OL,7,Fallowing overnight frost to develop in
OL,8,Fplaces, as well as a few mist and fog
OL,9,Fpatches. Cloudier around the coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FA chilly morning with a few
OL,12,Ffog patches possible. Then staying dry
OL,13,Fwith bright or sunny spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping. Chance of frost and fog
OL,15,Fpatches again overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
