OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells, chance of the
OL,7,Fodd shower towards Deeside on
OL,8,FWednesday and Thursday. Turning cooler
OL,9,Fon Wednesday and Thursday with
OL,10,Fovernight frost possible.
